                <pb facs="0816" n="746" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg746"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Telegram from Mr. Gallegos to Mr. Bátres.</hi></head>
                <p>The American ship Ounalaska, with fraudulent papers to Guayaquil, Drought from
                    San Francisco to Acajutla arms and war material for revolutionists. The ship and
                    cargo are now in possession of the Government and undergoing the judicial
                    process of appraisement.</p>
                <closer><signed>SALVADOR GALLEGOS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
